## Purpose
Keep `instruction.md` focused on concise signatures and specs.

## Applies When
- Editing or reading `instruction.md`.

## Do
- Store only function/class/pattern signatures + short implementation specs (purpose, I/O, side-effects).
- Keep each entry: 1 signature line + ≤3 bullets.
- Update whenever canonical APIs change.

## Don’t
- Don’t include full implementations, long examples, or background prose.
